{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14309","headline":"勅目至家兄蒙淮南仆射杜公奏授秘校兼节度参谋同书寄上 · 窦庠","name":"勅目至家兄蒙淮南仆射杜公奏授秘校兼节度参谋同书寄上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝市三千里，园庐二十春。\n步兵终日饮，原宪四时贫。\n桂树留人久，蓬山入梦新。\n鹤书承处重，鹊语喜时频。\n草奏才偏委，嘉谋事最亲。\n榻因徐孺解，醴爲穆生陈。\n卫国今多士，荆州好寄身。\n烟霄定从此，非假问陶钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}